  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the coconut milk, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the brine dried Thai eggplant and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the yeast and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
